Source: mpz
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Oleg Antonyan  <oleg.b.antonyan@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10), build-essential, cmake, qt6-tools-dev, qt6-base-dev, qt6-multimedia-dev, libqt6svg6-dev, libgl-dev
Standards-Version: 3.9.4
Homepage: https://github.com/olegantonyan/mpz

Package: mpz
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Music player for big local collections. Treats your folders with music as a library. Features 3-column UI: directory tree viewer, playlists list and tracks from current playlist. Similar to "album list" in Foobar2000.
